Intend for Barney to have the pathos that he did or in like that scene with Marshall stealing and Barney stealing all things Was it was that just a comedy driver that Barney would steal all his girls and only 10 12 episodes later?
是不是一开始就打算让巴尼展现出后来的那种深情？还是说像马修和巴尼抢东西的那场戏，巴尼抢走了他所有的女孩，仅仅过10到12集之后——

00:45:19.539 --> 00:45:22.096
Did you did you think oh we can reconnect that?
你们当时有没有想过“哦，我们可以把这个串联起来”？

