00:51:37.860 --> 00:51:39.439
Yeah, that was when it started.
对，就是从那时候开始的。

00:51:39.439 --> 00:51:43.159
Yeah, because once we got our fourth season, then we were in syndication.
对，因为一旦我们拿到了第四季，我们就能进行联合播出（syndication）了。

00:51:43.159 --> 00:51:55.949
That meant 100 episodes, which means that we could then have, and so that was the big turning point, like if we can get a season four pick up, then we might go six or seven seasons because then they'll have more vested interests to have more episodes.
这意味着100集，这意味着我们可以拥有，所以那是一个巨大的转折点，如果我们能获得第四季的续订，那么我们可能会拍六季或七季，因为这样他们就会有更多既得利益来制作更多的集数。

